# MC-X-F13, beside it (writer 9). v1's amt is 0 PLN, so pay[]'s when is false at its booking cut: it didn't exist
# then, A₀ = 0 (E §5 step 1). v2 (known 2027-03-01) makes it exist, "δ = Aᵥ" = +100.00 PLN; v3 (known 2027-04-01)
# ends it, "δ = −A_previous" = -100.00 PLN (E §5 step 3): two adjustments (step 4), summing to 0.00 PLN. snap13
# found the legs to compare in the booked instance (none) or the step's (none under v3), and lost v3's.
=== m.tally
model f13
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "MC-X-F13 (beside it): a plan instance that a later version makes exist and a version after that ends."

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source s "s"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input pay_day: date

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  when amt > 0 PLN
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask q1: count(a in adjustments over ..)
ask q2: sum(a.change for a in adjustments over ..)
ask q3: a.change for a in adjustments over ..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  amt = 0 PLN
  pay_day = 2027-02-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2027-01-01 start

version v2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2027-03-01
  replace amt = 100.00 PLN

version v3
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2027-04-01
  replace amt = 0 PLN
=== expect
q1: 2
  cut 2027-12-31
q2: 0.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
q3 (a = adjustments[pay.cash, v2]): 100.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
q3 (a = adjustments[pay.cash, v3]): -100.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
